     A* FLSHRTP - material shortages against a work order.  (GJA-917)
     A*
     A* A shortage is tied to the operation it blocks (FLSHSEQ), so the
     A* board can say which step is stalled rather than only that the
     A* order is short.
     A*
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R FLSHRTR                   TEXT('Work order material short')
     A            FLSHWO         8P 0       COLHDG('Work' 'Order')
     A                                      TEXT('Work order number')
     A            FLSHPART      15A         COLHDG('Part' 'Number')
     A                                      TEXT('Short part number')
     A            FLSHSEQ        3P 0       COLHDG('Op' 'Seq')
     A                                      TEXT('Operation blocked')
     A            FLSHQTYR       5P 0       COLHDG('Qty' 'Reqd')
     A                                      TEXT('Quantity required')
     A            FLSHQTYA       5P 0       COLHDG('Qty' 'Avail')
     A                                      TEXT('Quantity available')
     A            FLSHDUE        8S 0       COLHDG('Expected')
     A                                      TEXT('Expected date YYYYMMDD')
     A            FLSHSTAT       1A         COLHDG('Sts')
     A                                      TEXT('O=Open R=Resolved')
     A            FLSHPO         8A         COLHDG('Purchase' 'Order')
     A                                      TEXT('Purchase order number')
     A            FLSHVEND      30A         COLHDG('Vendor')
     A                                      TEXT('Supplying vendor')
     A          K FLSHWO
     A          K FLSHPART
